       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. AIDIDMS.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       IDMS-CONTROL SECTION.
       PROTOCOL. MODE IS BATCH DEBUG.
       DATA DIVISION.
       SCHEMA SECTION.
       DB AIDSS01 WITHIN AIDSCHM.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-TOTAL          PIC S9(11)V99 COMP-3 VALUE 0.
       COPY IDMS SUBSCHEMA-NAMES.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN.
           BIND RUN-UNIT.
           READY USAGE-MODE IS UPDATE.
           PERFORM 1000-POST THRU 1000-EXIT.
           FINISH.
           STOP RUN.
       1000-POST.
           OBTAIN FIRST DISTRICT-REC WITHIN DIST-AREA.
           PERFORM UNTIL DB-END-OF-SET
               OBTAIN NEXT PAYMENT-REC WITHIN DIST-PAYMENT
               ADD PAY-AMOUNT TO WS-TOTAL
               MODIFY DISTRICT-REC
           END-PERFORM.
           STORE AUDIT-REC.
       1000-EXIT.
           EXIT.
